# Grimoire's additions to the bundled en_US dictionary, part of GrimoireTUI
# (MIT licence). One word per line in Hunspell .dic syntax, word/FLAGS, using
# the affix flags from en_US.aff (S plural, M possessive, D -ed, G -ing,
# R -er, T -est, P -ness). Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# These are real words novelists use that the standard-size en_US list
# leaves out: variant spellings American dictionaries also accept, archaic
# forms for dialogue, and the everyday vocabulary of fantasy and science
# fiction. A book's invented names belong in its own dictionary.txt instead.

